    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d675">

                <pb facs="0830" n="736" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg736"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Resume duties to-day. Referring to your cablegram, received Paris, please
                    indicate what you would consider just decision <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Competitor</hi> case as basis for my efforts.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
